sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User (SPA)
  participant API as NestJS API
  participant RL as login_rate_limits (DB)
  participant DB as PostgreSQL (iam)
  participant C as Signed Cookie

  U->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login (tenant, email, password)
  API->>RL: Check attempts (10 / 15 min window)
  alt Locked out
    RL-->>API: Exceeded
    API-->>U: 429 Too Many Requests
  else Allowed
    API->>DB: Fetch user + tenant + password policy
    API->>API: Argon2id verify
    alt Invalid
      API->>RL: Increment failure
      API-->>U: 401 Unauthorized
    else Valid
      API->>DB: Create iam.sessions (hash, tenant_id, TTL 2h)
      API->>C: Set httpOnly+secure+sameSite cookie (signed)
      API->>DB: Insert ops.audit_events (LOGIN)
      API-->>U: 200 + profile + permissions
    end
  end
  Note over U,API: Subsequent requests: cookie + X-CSRF-Token<br/>Idle timeout 30 min · Absolute TTL 2 h · Server-side revocation
